          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Kenneth S. Geller, the Internal Revenue Code requires corporations to pay tax on net income, but the DISC and FSC statutes give favorable tax treatment to the portion of income attributable to export sales."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "18d37390b53149d206255469e7382ba9bec6d4de0c41b49dc8612654a351d582",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-18d37390b531-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, the Court asked how the statutory proposition regarding export income is found in the law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "18d37390b53149d206255469e7382ba9bec6d4de0c41b49dc8612654a351d582",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-18d37390b531-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justices questioned whether the rules for DISC differ from those for other jurisdictions such as Puerto Rico, Europe, or Saudi Arabia."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "18d37390b53149d206255469e7382ba9bec6d4de0c41b49dc8612654a351d582",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-18d37390b531-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, the Court asked whether all research and development costs must be allocated to the DISC when a business engages in both export sales and R&D in the same SIC code."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "18d37390b53149d206255469e7382ba9bec6d4de0c41b49dc8612654a351d582",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-18d37390b531-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 49,
              "start": 49
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, a hypothetical about \u201cfish/roses\u201d was raised to clarify whether R&D costs are charged to the DISC only when the products share the same SIC grouping."
      }
    ],
