            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Kenneth S. Geller, the case concerns whether Boeing\u2019s export income qualifies for tax incentives under the Domestic International Sales Corporation (DISC) and Foreign Sales Corporation (FSC) statutes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Kenneth S. Geller (Petitioner)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "18d37390b53149d206255469e7382ba9bec6d4de0c41b49dc8612654a351d582",
