            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 56,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Kenneth S. Geller (Petitioner), according to Kenneth S. Geller (Petitioner), boeing argues that Congress created the DISC and FSC statutes to encourage exports and to allow immediate deductibility of research and development expenses."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "18d37390b53149d206255469e7382ba9bec6d4de0c41b49dc8612654a351d582",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-18d37390b531-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Government, the United States contends that research and development costs must be allocated to the DISC, which would reduce the tax benefit for export income."
      }
    ],
