              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Government, boeing grouped its export transactions by product line (e.g., 747s, 767s) rather than by SIC code, which it argues is permissible under the regulations."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Kenneth S. Geller (Petitioner)",
